WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.355
Toad hopped around his new yellow cart.

2
00:00:20.356 --> 00:00:24.636
"Toad seems very excited," said Mole.

3
00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:29.947
"Did he say we are going on a trip?" asked Rat.

4
00:00:29.948 --> 00:00:33.051
Toad stopped in front of them.

5
00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:37.535
"Well, I can't go all by myself!" said Toad.

6
00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:40.503
"Forget it!" said Rat.

7
00:00:40.504 --> 00:00:44.605
"But you must see the world!" cried Toad.

8
00:00:44.606 --> 00:00:48.407
"My world is the river," said Rat.

9
00:00:48.408 --> 00:00:52.404
"Well, a trip might be fun," said Mole.

10
00:00:52.405 --> 00:00:56.432
Rat frowned and crossed his arms.

11
00:00:56.433 --> 00:01:01.042
"We don't have to decide now," said Toad.

12
00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:03.017
"Lunch is ready!"

13
00:01:03.018 --> 00:01:06.411
They all went into the house.

14
00:01:06.412 --> 00:01:09.534
They sat down at the dining table.

15
00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:14.458
Everything inside was nice and fancy.

16
00:01:14.459 --> 00:01:18.014
The food was excellent.

17
00:01:18.015 --> 00:01:23.078
"There is nothing like traveling by cart!" said Toad.

18
00:01:23.079 --> 00:01:28.166
Toad spread his map across the table.

19
00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:31.407
He pointed at places they could visit.

20
00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:36.148
"Every day you see something new!" Toad said.

21
00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:40.020
"It sounds so exciting!" said Mole.

22
00:01:40.021 --> 00:01:43.215
Rat looked up from his plate.

23
00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:47.376
"Do you really want to go?" he asked Mole.

24
00:01:47.377 --> 00:01:49.595
Mole nodded eagerly.

25
00:01:49.596 --> 00:01:54.027
"Well, okay," said Rat.

26
00:01:54.028 --> 00:01:57.888
"Hooray!" said Toad.

27
00:01:57.889 --> 00:02:01.879
They went out to the stable again.

28
00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:06.409
Toad tied his gray horse up to the cart.

29
00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.266
Mole and Rat climbed in.

30
00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:12.677
Toad took the reins.

31
00:02:12.678 --> 00:02:18.844
"Off we go!" cried Toad.
